      "sourceTextSha256": "0c3170bbe88b5d511d4b11f9348aa8fa3100cb0fa1bdb94090bbeb8425d09452",
      "text": "Day 5 · Take in the rare and breathtaking beauty of the Perito Moreno Glacier, one of UNESCO’s jewels. Your guide picks you up at the hotel in the morning for a full-day tour, sharing details about the glacier and the national park on the way. The first stop is a series of walkways with views of the glacier, ideal for photos; the bus then continues through the park’s natural scenery, and you walk along the walkways to watch chunks of ice break off and crash into the water. At the end of the day, the bus takes you back to your hotel.",
